  "description": "Eight state/territory groups, each split into exactly two retailer rectangles (Woolworths and Coles). No unexplained extra data tiles. Each jurisdiction header and each retailer leaf is labelled. Exact values are repeated in an accessible HTML key below.",
  "background": null,
  "width": 850,
  "height": 440,
  "padding": 4,
  "autosize": {
    "type": "fit",
    "contains": "padding"
  },
